    "created_at": "2026-02-12T18:49:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T18:49:39Z",
    "body": "From what I can tell in chromium, line-height is ignored via intrinsic sizing, but there isn't anything in the style system which always sets line-height to initial.\n\nline-height works on the select element when it has base appearance.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
