    "created_at": "2026-02-13T18:17:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-13T18:17:54Z",
    "body": "Thanks, I didn't look in LayoutThemeDefault but that does indeed look like its forcing line-height to initial via the style system for drop-down select elements.\n\nThe oldest commit I could find which added this was here: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/a3f120e9ff9163ef830330cb645df46da03a79d8\n\nThere isn't any cited reason that line-height is forced to initial, but I'd rather try to specify that than change it since I guess its been like that forever, especially since it can be overridden successfully for base appearance.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
